, 0.051434069871902466, -0.03400243818759918, -0.016571734100580215, -0.06596042215824127, -0.0021334332413971424, -0.06127411127090454, 0.03197995945811272, -0.0005398261127993464, 0.0005662430194206536, 0.010819154791533947, -0.10582155734300613, -0.036200448870658875, 0.02547682262957096, 0.0917176604270935, 0.03773649409413338, -0.03209111467003822, -0.07311512529850006, 0.052278220653533936, 0.06348644196987152, -0.03221755474805832, -0.010324343107640743, 0.056716326624155045, -0.03777535632252693, -0.06681010127067566, -0.008746590465307236]], "metadata": [{"answer": "\nLet\u2019s confirm the shared range is [-10, 10]. To calibrate preferences and keep things stable, I propose starting at <VALUE>0</VALUE> and then adjust in small steps based on everyone\u2019s feedback.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>4</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>5</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>3</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "\nTo reduce unnecessary risk while staying incremental, I propose <VALUE>2</VALUE>.\nThis is a cautious compromise from 3 that keeps us moving without overshooting.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>3</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis is a clearer, confident step from 3 that still keeps us incremental.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>4</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "\nStepping down slightly should improve stability while keeping us in a robust, balanced zone. <VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s be more decisive with a firm yet moderate step upward. <VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>5</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>3</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>3</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>1</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "56bf600e-7ce6-416c-95d8-7d57d2a68f9a"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\nA cautious small step down helps avoid unnecessary risk while staying close to the current point.\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nIf this is tolerable, we can reassess and adjust by at most one step next.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nA modest but more decisive step that strengthens our position while staying within the permitted adjustment.\nIf this feels too quick, we can reassess next turn based on others\u2019 direction and comfort.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\nA gentle one-step up remains moderate and responsive to recent proposals.\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nIf this is uncomfortable, we can revert to 3 next.\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\nA small, cautious upward nudge keeps us close to recent proposals while testing tolerance for modest improvement.\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\nA modest step down enhances stability and aligns with the balanced midpoint of recent proposals.\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\nA firmer, clearer stance aligns with recent upward momentum while staying within a cautious adjustment window.\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nIf this feels too assertive, we can ease back slightly next turn.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\nA cautious two-step down tempers risk while staying close to recent proposals; let's test this and reassess.\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nIf this feels off, a brief rationale will help calibrate the next step.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\nMaintaining a steady low-positive setting supports a balanced, robust design while we gauge tolerance. If upward pressure persists, we can trial a small nudge next.\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da635c3"}, {"answer": "\nA firmer stance tests whether we can commit to a clearer, higher setting while staying within the allowed step. If that feels too bold, we can ease to a nearby option next turn.\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "f8d18c1e-e019-4e17-ac2d-ddde1da6